getd r0 r6 29
bne r0 r8 Bad
getd r0 r6 9
bne r0 1 Bad
getd r0 r6 12
bne r0 r13 Bad
getd r0 r6 32
beq r0 2 Transformer
bne r10 r9 Bad
j Direction
Transformer:
getd r0 r6 14
add r0 r0 r9
bne r0 r10 Bad
Direction:
move r1 0
Check:
bge r1 r3 Next
beq r1 r4 CheckNext
mul r0 r1 8
add r0 r0 33
get r5 d0 r0
beq r5 r8 Bad
add r0 r0 1
get r5 d0 r0
beq r5 r7 Bad
CheckNext:
